Forms and payments in separate places usually mean someone matches names to payments by hand. Formkit takes the form and the payment together: money goes through Stripe straight to your own account, and we take no cut. The free plan has unlimited forms, responses and members.

Want me to send a sample of how your form would look with the payment built in?

